<title>THAILAND: Iran to supply crude to new Thai refinery.</title>
<headline>Iran to supply crude to new Thai refinery.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Iranian Oil Co will supply 60,000 barrels per day (bpd) of crude oil to Sukhothai Petroleum Co Ltd under a deal signed earlier this week, an industry ministry official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sukhothai is building a 125,000-barrel-per-day refinery in the southern province of Songkla.</p>
<p>The $835 million refinery is scheduled to start operations by 2004 and the company plans to export at least 80 percent of its refined products.</p>
<p>It will be Thailand's first export-oriented refinery.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
